# GAMBIT environment files
#
# Each service has its own example file; copy it and fill it in:
#   server/.env.example        -> server/.env          (loaded by the game server itself)
#   frontend/.env.example      -> frontend/.env.local  (loaded by Next.js)
#   chess-engine/.env.example  -> chess-engine/.env    (NOT loaded by the engine: export it first,
#                                                       see setup.md section 5)
#
# Every variable, per platform (required, default, secret or not): DEPLOY.md sections 3c, 4b, 5b, 8c.
# ENGINE_SHARED_SECRET must have the same value in all three files (openssl rand -hex 32).
# Placeholders only: never commit real keys.
